{
  "dom_id": "step-q24916",
  "name": "Question 9",
  "problem": "Find the range of the function $y=6\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x).$",
  "worked_solution": "The range of $\\operatorname{cos}⁡x$ is\n\n$$\n-1\\le \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\le 1.\n$$\n\nHorizontal shifts and stretches have no effect on the range. Therefore,\n\n$$\n-1\\le \\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)\\le 1.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the above inequality by $6,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & -1\\le \\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)\\le 1 \\\\  & -6\\le 6\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)\\le 6 \\\\  & -6\\le y\\le 6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the range is $y\\in [-6,6].$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
